OL,3,GNEWSAThree jailed as part of people
OL,4,Asmuggling gang bust
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gang of 21 people smugglers has been
OL,7,Fsentenced to a combined total of 84
OL,8,Fyears for helping people travel from
OL,9,Fthe UK to France illegally by hiding
OL,10,Fthem in lorries and passing through
OL,11,FDover.
OL,13,FA National Crime Agency spokesperson
OL,14,F(NCA) said the gang was sentenced to a
OL,15,Fcombined total of 84 years and the
OL,16,Finvestigation covered 10 different
OL,17,Fsmuggling runs between July 2025 and
OL,18,FJanuary 2026.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
